# This repo is public twice over: it deploys to aiwithpelumi.com and the GitHub
# remote is public. Anything staged here is published, so a stray `git add .`
# is a leak rather than a mess. Loose notes at the root are ignored by default
# and the site docs are named back in below — matching by pattern on purpose,
# since one of the files being kept out is one whose name is the problem.
/*.md
